---
title: "AgentDesk channel session on tmux, across one server restart"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: Normal
    lg1: Restart
    lg2: Stuck
    lg3: Breaks NoDeadlock or RowNamesSession or RowOnlyWithTurn
    lg4: Breaks NoDeadlock in some cases
    lg5: Path to the NoDeadlock or RowNamesSession or RowOnlyWithTurn bug
  }
  class lg0 blue
  class lg1 yellow
  class lg2 pink
  class lg3 breaks
  class lg4 mayBreak
  class lg5 bugPath
  s0: Idle
  s1: Server down
  s2: Restarting, no turn row
  s3: Turn starting
  s4: Server down, turn row on disk
  s5: Turn running
  s6: Restarting, turn row not picked up
  s7: Turn running, session died
  s8: Stop: session killed, row still on disk
  s9: Starting a fresh session for the turn
  s10: Writing the prompt into the live session
  s11: Open, a turn row names a missing session
  s12: Open, a turn row with no running turn
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: the server crashes
  s0 --> s0: a message arrives
  s1 --> s2: the server boots
  s0 --> s3: a message starts a turn
  s3 --> s4: the server crashes
  s3 --> s5: a new session starts with the prompt [no live session]
  s4 --> s6: the server boots
  s5 --> s4: the server crashes
  s5 --> s7: Claude exits in the session
  s5 --> s0: the answer is posted
  s5 --> s8: you stop the turn
  s6 --> s2: recovery posts a notice and clears the row [session gone]
  s6 --> s6: the recovery probe fails, so the row is left or watcher restore has nothing to do or a message arrives
  s2 --> s0: intake opens
  s7 --> s0: the watcher posts a died notice
  s8 --> s0: the turn row is cleared
  s6 --> s5: recovery reattaches [session live] or watcher restore adopts the live session
  s6 --> s9: recovery retries the turn [pane dead]
  s6 --> s11: intake opens
  s3 --> s10: the session is live, so the turn reuses it
  s9 --> s5: a new session starts with the prompt
  s6 --> s12: intake opens
  s10 --> s5: the prompt reaches the session
  s10 --> s9: the prompt write fails, so the turn recreates
  classDef breaks fill:#ffecee,stroke:#e72e3b,stroke-width:2.5px,color:#cd2834
  classDef mayBreak fill:#fff3e6,stroke:#e8730c,stroke-width:2.5px,color:#b85a06
  class s0 blue
  class s0 bugPath
  class s1 yellow
  class s2 yellow
  class s3 blue
  class s3 bugPath
  class s4 yellow
  class s4 bugPath
  class s6 yellow
  class s6 bugPath
  class s8 blue
  class s10 blue
  class s10 mayBreak
  class s11 pink
  class s11 breaks
  class s11 bugPath
  class s12 pink
  class s12 breaks
